WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.665 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:39.825 --> 01:40.665
Good.

01:41.305 --> 01:42.265
Keep it steady.

01:42.985 --> 01:43.985
Not bad.

01:57.425 --> 01:58.265
What are you doing?

01:59.985 --> 02:03.025
Do you just slam on the brakes
and hope you hit the right gear?

02:03.105 --> 02:04.505
Is that how you drive?

02:05.145 --> 02:06.505
Start over.

02:06.585 --> 02:07.905
Put it in gear.

02:07.985 --> 02:09.785
-In gear.
-Here.

02:09.864 --> 02:11.865
Go on. Signal.

02:12.385 --> 02:13.865
Good. Go.

02:18.585 --> 02:20.305
Forget it. Take a break.

02:20.385 --> 02:21.745
Switch drivers. Your turn.

02:26.345 --> 02:27.825
OK. Shift gears. Go.

02:28.785 --> 02:30.705
Good. Turn left.

02:32.305 --> 02:34.665
Good. Turn left.

02:38.185 --> 02:39.545
Stop! Stop, now!

02:40.945 --> 02:43.505
Did they put the wiper switch
in the wrong place?

02:43.585 --> 02:46.185
Should I apologize
to you two on its behalf?

02:47.065 --> 02:49.745
I… I give up on you two.

02:49.825 --> 02:51.185
Unbelievable.

02:58.585 --> 03:02.305
LOVE IS STOLEN CANDY

03:05.345 --> 03:07.865
Luke's in charge now,
and he's bringing the heat.

03:07.945 --> 03:10.105
That meeting was intense.

03:11.225 --> 03:12.745
Cut it.

03:12.825 --> 03:14.425
The overall budget is too high,
and the return is too low.

03:14.505 --> 03:15.505
Cut it.

03:16.665 --> 03:17.825
Cut it. Cut it.

03:17.905 --> 03:19.105
Cut it.

03:19.185 --> 03:21.865
Unless you've thought this through,
my advice

03:21.945 --> 03:23.105
is to cut it.

03:24.225 --> 03:25.345
Every budget got slashed.

03:25.425 --> 03:26.505
Not a cent gets spent.

03:27.545 --> 03:29.705
Clear goals, solid action plans,

03:29.785 --> 03:32.425
and every expense fully accounted for.
I learned a lot again.

03:33.905 --> 03:35.705
But I think Luke might have made

03:35.785 --> 03:38.585
a lot of enemies in that meeting.

03:38.665 --> 03:41.105
He's not worried, so why are you?

03:41.185 --> 03:42.705
He doesn't care at all.

03:42.785 --> 03:44.265
He's so brutally direct.

03:44.345 --> 03:46.585
-It's so sexy.
-I'm telling you,

03:46.665 --> 03:49.865
those old fogies
needed to be put in their place.

03:49.945 --> 03:51.745
They spent money like water,

03:51.825 --> 03:53.425
then dragged their feet during audits.

03:53.505 --> 03:57.105
I think I understand why the board
put Luke in charge.

03:58.505 --> 03:59.785
Who else could do it?

03:59.865 --> 04:03.385
Just like you said,
that's this stubborn mule's…

04:03.465 --> 04:05.745
Irresistible charm.

04:07.905 --> 04:09.265
Tell me.

04:09.345 --> 04:12.185
-Have you lost your mind?
-Me?

04:12.265 --> 04:14.305
You must have,
taking on that basketball game.

04:14.385 --> 04:16.504
It's a thankless job.

04:16.585 --> 04:19.145
Actually, I've realized
that to move a project forward,

04:19.225 --> 04:21.785
you need to get everyone
in the internal process on board.

04:21.865 --> 04:25.505
This gives me a chance
to get to know people in every department.

04:26.425 --> 04:29.425
Things are always easier
when people know you.

04:30.905 --> 04:33.585
Not bad, Shang Zhitao.

04:33.665 --> 04:35.905
You've got a strategy.
I underestimated you.

04:36.785 --> 04:37.705
I'll do my best.

04:39.545 --> 04:40.585
Eat more meat.

04:40.665 --> 04:43.265
Get some vitamins and protein in you.

04:43.945 --> 04:46.145
Let's see whether
you're still smiling in a few days.

05:00.345 --> 05:01.225
Tao.

05:02.025 --> 05:02.945
Was that Flora?

05:03.865 --> 05:05.225
Why did she run off so fast?

05:05.305 --> 05:06.785
Luke. Tracy.

05:08.505 --> 05:10.425
Maybe she thinks we're terrifying.

05:11.025 --> 05:12.305
Not us.

05:12.385 --> 05:13.505
Probably just you.

05:15.825 --> 05:17.825
But Flora really is impressive.

05:18.425 --> 05:20.465
She's diligent and dependable.

05:21.545 --> 05:22.985
I like her.

05:24.825 --> 05:25.945
Let's go.

05:37.745 --> 05:38.985
Oh my.

05:39.065 --> 05:40.385
You didn't have to bring
this yourself, Mr. Luan.

05:40.465 --> 05:41.305
Don't mention it.

05:56.385 --> 05:58.105
I know it's hard for your team
to rein in spending,

05:59.145 --> 06:03.185
but I want you to understand
that I'm doing you a favor here.

06:06.265 --> 06:07.545
I've heard.

06:07.625 --> 06:10.145
Headquarters is being especially strict
about budgets this year.

06:11.425 --> 06:12.265
Yes.

06:13.625 --> 06:15.665
Mr. Lin's annual review is still ongoing,

06:16.865 --> 06:18.905
and several of last year's budgets
still haven't been approved.

06:19.585 --> 06:22.185
If they're investigated, the lightest
punishment is a formal warning.

06:22.865 --> 06:24.025
Worse, someone could be fired.

06:24.105 --> 06:27.625
And in serious cases,
criminal charges are possible.

06:32.065 --> 06:34.385
You're in charge
of Lime's biggest project next year.

06:35.265 --> 06:38.265
Keep the budget under control,
and no one can pin anything on you.

06:41.745 --> 06:44.745
I knew you weren't trying
to put me in my place.

06:44.825 --> 06:46.745
I should thank you
for playing bad cop for me.

06:48.345 --> 06:49.505
After all these years,

06:49.585 --> 06:50.665
we know each other well.

06:51.305 --> 06:54.305
After all, we've both
done plenty of scheming

06:54.385 --> 06:55.865
behind each other's backs.

06:58.385 --> 06:59.665
Neither of us would back down.

07:03.665 --> 07:05.585
That was…

07:06.145 --> 07:07.425
my fault.

07:07.505 --> 07:09.345
I like trying to be clever.

07:09.425 --> 07:11.185
What was I thinking,
trying to outsmart you?

07:11.785 --> 07:15.145
All right. From now on,
you've got my full cooperation.

07:16.985 --> 07:19.105
Then let's put the past behind us.

07:19.945 --> 07:20.945
Agreed.

07:22.545 --> 07:23.745
But there's one small thing.

07:24.425 --> 07:27.225
Do we really have to hold
that basketball game?

07:27.745 --> 07:29.105
There's barely any budget.

07:29.185 --> 07:30.745
If we win, we offend the client.

07:30.825 --> 07:32.825
If we lose, Lime loses face.

07:32.905 --> 07:34.065
A game is a game.

07:34.145 --> 07:35.265
Winning and losing are part of it.

07:35.985 --> 07:39.705
Giving it your all
is the best way to respect a friend.

07:41.145 --> 07:42.025
That's why you're the boss.

07:43.625 --> 07:44.625
You always see the big picture.

07:48.065 --> 07:51.305
A basketball game for 60 people
on a 5,000-yuan budget?

07:53.385 --> 07:54.505
Did today's meeting mean nothing to you?

07:55.105 --> 07:56.545
What did I say?

07:57.305 --> 08:00.185
If you haven't thought it through, cut it.

08:01.105 --> 08:02.665
Keep the budget tight.

08:02.745 --> 08:06.465
This game doesn't count
toward our workload or our team's KPI.

08:06.545 --> 08:09.745
I carved that 5,000 yuan
out of my own budget for you.

08:11.425 --> 08:12.265
Just do what you can.

08:12.345 --> 08:13.465
Whatever you manage is fine.

08:21.065 --> 08:22.345
Dinner's ready.

08:23.065 --> 08:24.305
Tao.

08:24.385 --> 08:26.345
To celebrate Tao's promotion,

08:26.425 --> 08:28.305
we're having something special tonight.

08:28.385 --> 08:30.505
Thanks, Zhu. I still have some work to do.
You guys eat first.

08:30.585 --> 08:32.105
No rush. We'll wait.

08:33.185 --> 08:34.345
I'll check and get back to you.

08:34.425 --> 08:37.225
Dongxiang lamb, simply boiled.

08:37.305 --> 08:38.865
It smells amazing.

08:38.945 --> 08:41.585
The lamb practically melts in your mouth.

08:41.664 --> 08:43.024
-My mom sent it.
-Give your mom my regards.

08:43.105 --> 08:44.305
Tao.

08:44.985 --> 08:46.105
Come eat.

08:47.105 --> 08:49.945
Hello. How much would it cost
to rent your venue?

08:51.585 --> 08:53.785
That much? All right.

08:54.385 --> 08:57.145
Did she get on her boss's bad side?

08:57.225 --> 08:58.705
-Why is she doing grunt work?
-Hello.

08:58.785 --> 09:02.065
I was wondering
if you could offer us a better rate.

09:03.185 --> 09:04.225
All right.

09:04.745 --> 09:05.745
Thank you.

09:09.705 --> 09:11.665
Tao. Come eat first, before it gets cold.

09:12.425 --> 09:13.265
Come on.

09:22.545 --> 09:25.185
Our poor girl's worn out.

09:25.905 --> 09:26.945
Have some meat first.

09:27.505 --> 09:28.705
Build your strength back up.

09:28.785 --> 09:29.945
Eat first.

09:30.025 --> 09:31.505
Have some water spinach.

09:31.585 --> 09:33.865
It might help you work things out.

09:33.945 --> 09:35.865
I'm not hungry.

09:35.945 --> 09:38.745
Why am I under so much more pressure
after getting promoted?

09:38.825 --> 09:40.385
They only gave me a 5,000-yuan budget.

09:40.465 --> 09:43.745
I need to rent a venue, buy jerseys,
and prepare gifts.

09:43.825 --> 09:46.065
That's not even counting transportation,

09:46.145 --> 09:47.825
energy bars, and bottled water.

09:47.905 --> 09:49.145
Your boss has gone too far.

09:50.465 --> 09:53.065
As a seasoned event planner
who does this every day,

09:53.145 --> 09:55.225
I can tell you with complete confidence

09:56.145 --> 09:57.265
that with the budget your boss gave you,

09:57.345 --> 09:59.745
you'd be better off holding up a sign
and begging on the street.

10:01.345 --> 10:04.985
You might even meet a couple of kind souls
who'll toss you a few coins.

10:11.265 --> 10:12.345
That's it!

10:12.425 --> 10:13.465
Why didn't I think of that?

10:15.225 --> 10:16.465
Are you really going begging?

10:16.545 --> 10:19.945
In advertising, we call begging
securing sponsorships.

10:28.225 --> 10:31.185
Mr. Liu, this is Flora from Lime.

10:31.865 --> 10:34.665
I'm calling because Yueteng and Lime

10:34.745 --> 10:36.865
are planning a friendly basketball game,

10:36.945 --> 10:39.945
and we'd like
some of our top suppliers to join us.

10:40.625 --> 10:43.625
I remember your venue
has an indoor basketball court, right?

10:44.585 --> 10:46.425
No… We couldn't possibly.

11:02.425 --> 11:05.905
Our Ms. Shang is really going places.

11:07.465 --> 11:08.305
Good for her.

11:08.385 --> 11:09.945
If I had someone
like Shang Zhitao on my team,

11:10.025 --> 11:11.145
I'd be smiling in my sleep.

11:13.065 --> 11:14.625
She's always been amazing.

11:27.825 --> 11:28.665
Come in.

11:33.145 --> 11:34.185
Boss,

11:34.265 --> 11:37.865
could you spare
some of your valuable time this afternoon

11:37.945 --> 11:39.665
to grace the basketball game
with your presence?

11:40.945 --> 11:42.105
I never attend events like that.

11:43.665 --> 11:47.905
Then may I take the afternoon off
to cheer on our athletes?

11:53.185 --> 11:54.545
What help would you be?

11:55.305 --> 11:56.945
You're just looking for an excuse
to skip work.

11:58.745 --> 12:01.585
Shang Zhitao is my prized mentee.

12:01.665 --> 12:03.705
I should at least be there to support her.

12:04.465 --> 12:06.705
She's really come into her own.

12:06.785 --> 12:10.705
She organized the whole basketball game
without spending a cent.

12:10.785 --> 12:13.625
From jerseys and the venue
to food, drinks, and everything else,

12:13.705 --> 12:15.385
she found sponsors for it all.

12:15.905 --> 12:17.705
She's put together quite an event.

12:17.785 --> 12:19.505
Where did she find the sponsors?

12:19.585 --> 12:22.585
She offered suppliers priority
consideration for the next three years

12:22.665 --> 12:25.945
and got them competing
for sponsorship slots.

12:26.905 --> 12:28.385
Pretty clever, isn't she?

12:29.145 --> 12:30.145
Not bad.

12:31.625 --> 12:32.665
In that case,

12:32.745 --> 12:37.105
use this opportunity to see firsthand
how cooperative our suppliers are.

12:37.745 --> 12:40.225
So I am going there for work.

12:40.985 --> 12:41.865
Give me a break.

12:42.705 --> 12:44.985
Go before I change my mind.

12:45.065 --> 12:45.905
You got it.

12:46.425 --> 12:47.425
Lumi.

12:47.505 --> 12:48.825
Nice new hairstyle.

12:50.505 --> 12:51.625
I know.

12:52.185 --> 12:53.025
Looking sharp yourself.

12:58.705 --> 13:02.665
YUETENG

13:02.745 --> 13:04.625
Jack, how's everything?

13:04.705 --> 13:07.385
The jerseys have arrived. Take a look.

13:07.465 --> 13:09.105
OK. Thanks for your hard work.

13:09.185 --> 13:10.025
No problem.

13:11.825 --> 13:13.705
-These look good.
-They do.

13:13.785 --> 13:15.105
-And here's another one.
-Great.

13:17.385 --> 13:19.505
-Shang Zhitao.
-Lumi.

13:19.585 --> 13:20.865
Not bad.

13:21.585 --> 13:24.305
You've got everything
running like clockwork.

13:24.385 --> 13:25.305
You've finally put your knack

13:25.385 --> 13:28.345
for playing capitalists at their own game
to good use.

13:28.425 --> 13:29.985
I learned from the best.

13:30.065 --> 13:32.265
You taught me that working hard alone
gets you nowhere at Lime.

13:32.345 --> 13:33.705
Flatterer.

13:33.785 --> 13:35.425
I couldn't have pulled this off.

13:35.505 --> 13:37.865
Even those penny-pinchers in Finance

13:37.945 --> 13:40.345
praised how well
you controlled the budget.

13:41.145 --> 13:43.105
Check out the fabric. What do you think?

13:43.185 --> 13:44.105
It's pretty good, right?

13:44.185 --> 13:47.185
The players will look great in these.

13:51.145 --> 13:52.825
A little something for you.

13:52.905 --> 13:53.825
With your new promotion,

13:53.905 --> 13:56.625
you'll want to make a splash
inside and outside the company.

14:00.025 --> 14:03.825
I appreciate the gesture,
but I make it a rule not to accept gifts.

14:06.345 --> 14:07.745
Mr. Luan, here's the thing.

14:07.825 --> 14:11.105
I know Lime created
a new supplier database for our project.

14:11.185 --> 14:14.705
I know several reliable suppliers
I've worked with for years.

14:15.825 --> 14:19.505
They're much easier to work with.

14:19.585 --> 14:22.945
Could you add them to the database?

14:26.425 --> 14:28.865
We'd be happy to consider them.
Send me their information.

14:28.945 --> 14:31.705
As long as they meet
our supplier database criteria

14:32.265 --> 14:34.705
and pass the compliance review,
they can be added.

14:35.265 --> 14:38.745
But if they don't qualify,
no one gets special treatment.

14:40.505 --> 14:44.225
That's why I've come
to discuss it with you, Mr. Luan.

14:44.745 --> 14:45.825
Make an exception.

14:45.905 --> 14:46.945
It's no big deal.

14:49.185 --> 14:53.825
Mr. Wan, Lime has
a very strict evaluation system.

14:53.905 --> 14:56.345
Companies admitted
to our supplier database

14:56.425 --> 14:58.305
must not only be easy to work with

14:58.385 --> 14:59.465
but also highly professional.

15:00.585 --> 15:03.385
We place great importance
on our future collaboration with Yueteng.

15:03.465 --> 15:07.665
We established this supplier system
precisely to avoid the mistakes

15:07.745 --> 15:10.345
that Chengbiao made
when working with Yueteng.

15:10.425 --> 15:13.025
So you see, if I make an exception,

15:13.945 --> 15:15.185
how can I expect others
to follow the rules?

15:18.985 --> 15:21.385
I didn't expect you
to be such a man of principle.

15:21.985 --> 15:23.185
You can still keep the gift.

15:23.985 --> 15:25.025
I truly appreciate it.

15:26.345 --> 15:27.345
We'll have opportunities in the future.

15:28.585 --> 15:30.585
All right. We'll discuss it another time.

15:30.665 --> 15:31.865
I'll be going, then.

15:36.705 --> 15:37.545
I'll see you out.

15:54.225 --> 15:54.905
LU MI

15:54.985 --> 15:56.705
<i>Luke, we won.</i>

15:56.785 --> 15:58.185
<i>Lime won!</i>

15:58.265 --> 15:59.345
<i>There's a celebration tonight.</i>

15:59.425 --> 16:01.745
-Come make an appearance.
-<i>I'm not going.</i>

16:02.425 --> 16:05.825
I know you're worried everyone
won't be comfortable around you,

16:05.905 --> 16:07.105
<i>but everyone's in high spirits.</i>

16:07.185 --> 16:09.305
<i>At the celebration,</i>
<i>all our colleagues will be there,</i>

16:09.385 --> 16:10.945
along with Yueteng's executives.

16:11.025 --> 16:12.905
<i>Just stop by and show your face.</i>

16:12.985 --> 16:15.265
I already met Wan Jun today.
I'm not going.

16:16.025 --> 16:18.625
That doesn't mean
you can't come celebrate with everyone.

16:20.185 --> 16:22.625
If he brings up the suppliers
at the banquet,

16:22.705 --> 16:23.665
don't discuss it privately.

16:23.745 --> 16:25.065
<i>Report it to me immediately.</i>

16:25.145 --> 16:26.745
I know what to do.

16:26.825 --> 16:28.265
But we're celebrating tonight.

16:28.345 --> 16:30.105
<i>We'll just drink. No work talk.</i>

16:30.185 --> 16:32.785
Anyway, whatever he says to you,
report it to me right away.

16:33.705 --> 16:36.505
Fine. I'll tell Flora too.

16:36.585 --> 16:39.865
<i>I just saw Wan Jun asking her</i>
<i>about the supplier database criteria.</i>

16:39.945 --> 16:42.985
-She's there too?
-Of course.

16:43.065 --> 16:44.225
She organized the event

16:44.305 --> 16:46.025
-and deserves most of the credit.
-Sure.

16:46.105 --> 16:47.425
-Our athletes
-We should work together sometime.

16:47.505 --> 16:49.345
-even gave her their medals.
-Thank you.

16:49.425 --> 16:52.465
<i>Mr. Wan praised her too,</i>
<i>saying she did a great job.</i>

16:52.545 --> 16:53.385
Bye.

16:55.745 --> 16:59.465
Looks like everyone in
the Business Division is an all-rounder.

16:59.545 --> 17:01.225
-Not really.
-Exactly.

17:01.305 --> 17:03.305
Organizing an event this big
is no easy feat.

17:03.385 --> 17:04.745
I'm John from the Commerce Division.

17:04.825 --> 17:07.184
Next time you need sponsors, come to me.

17:07.265 --> 17:08.265
Nice to meet you.

17:08.345 --> 17:09.265
-Bottoms up.
-All right.

17:09.345 --> 17:10.385
Bottoms up for what?

17:10.464 --> 17:11.704
Don't you dare pressure her to drink.

17:11.785 --> 17:13.865
Flora is our division's pride and joy.

17:13.944 --> 17:15.825
Anyone who pressures her answers to me.

17:15.905 --> 17:16.745
Drink with me first.

17:16.825 --> 17:18.025
-All right.
-Got it.

17:18.105 --> 17:19.105
Let's drink together.

17:19.184 --> 17:20.025
Cheers.

17:21.345 --> 17:22.345
We'll get going.

17:22.424 --> 17:23.464
Take it easy on the drinks.

17:28.265 --> 17:31.065
No wonder you keep drinking
without getting drunk.

17:31.145 --> 17:32.905
You've learned a little trick.

17:32.985 --> 17:34.905
I'm just putting
what I learned into practice.

17:34.985 --> 17:36.665
Clever girl.

17:36.745 --> 17:38.825
You did a great job.

17:38.905 --> 17:42.945
Now all those aloof Lime employees
know who you are.

17:43.025 --> 17:43.865
It was nothing.

17:45.665 --> 17:47.545
-I'm doomed.
-Why?

17:48.505 --> 17:51.865
Luan Nian isn't coming.
I'll never live this down.

17:52.505 --> 17:53.705
Luan Nian was supposed to come?

17:53.785 --> 17:55.065
He's not coming.

17:55.665 --> 17:57.465
During the basketball game this afternoon,

17:57.545 --> 18:00.545
I promised the girls in the Media Division

18:00.625 --> 18:04.505
I'd bring Luan Nian
to tonight's celebration.

18:04.585 --> 18:07.505
I've spent the whole afternoon

18:07.585 --> 18:09.345
answering questions about him.

18:11.305 --> 18:14.225
What… What gossip is there about him?

18:14.905 --> 18:16.665
His love life.

18:17.225 --> 18:20.025
He's handsome, rich,
single, and successful.

18:22.225 --> 18:24.305
Of course the girls are interested.

18:25.065 --> 18:30.825
I already promised them
I'd find out about his love life.

18:30.905 --> 18:33.145
If I do, they'll prioritize

18:33.225 --> 18:36.985
all our proposals for the next six months.

18:38.865 --> 18:42.905
Aren't you trading
your boss's privacy for favors?

18:42.985 --> 18:44.305
Don't be ridiculous.

18:44.905 --> 18:46.545
This is work.

18:46.625 --> 18:48.265
And who am I doing it for?

18:50.785 --> 18:55.265
I just don't understand
what there is to ask.

18:55.345 --> 18:57.745
Luan Nian is so cold.

18:57.825 --> 18:59.905
Why is everyone so interested in him?

19:07.505 --> 19:11.865
Tao, why don't you ask him to come?

19:11.945 --> 19:14.745
You seem to know how to handle him.

19:14.825 --> 19:16.145
Me?

19:16.225 --> 19:17.545
No. I can't.

19:17.625 --> 19:18.905
There's no way.

19:18.985 --> 19:20.905
Don't be modest.

19:20.985 --> 19:22.265
Luan Nian is difficult,

19:22.345 --> 19:24.625
but I always feel
you can get through to him.

19:26.625 --> 19:28.385
I've put my reputation on the line.

19:28.465 --> 19:30.745
-Help me out. I'm your mentor, after all.
-I really can't.

19:45.825 --> 19:47.025
He's here.

19:47.105 --> 19:52.065
Next week's Yueteng proposal
depends on tonight.

19:56.945 --> 19:58.025
Hello, Mr. Luan.

19:58.105 --> 20:00.025
Mr. Luan.

20:00.105 --> 20:01.425
Mr. Luan.

20:02.065 --> 20:03.985
No need to be so formal. Relax.

20:04.585 --> 20:05.505
Have fun.

20:05.585 --> 20:06.745
Boss,

20:06.825 --> 20:09.145
your presence really lights up the place.

20:09.225 --> 20:11.625
I've never seen you this enthusiastic
when entertaining clients.

20:14.025 --> 20:16.105
We're all having a drink and unwinding.

20:16.185 --> 20:18.025
Why don't you have one too and loosen up?

20:18.105 --> 20:18.945
I'm perfectly relaxed.

20:19.785 --> 20:20.625
You go ahead and relax.

20:22.145 --> 20:23.185
-Tao.
-Yes?

20:23.265 --> 20:24.465
Fill Mr. Luan's glass.

20:30.025 --> 20:31.145
Mr. Luan.

20:31.825 --> 20:33.025
Welcome.

20:35.345 --> 20:38.305
Tao. You're the star
of tonight's celebration dinner

20:38.385 --> 20:40.305
and the one who made it all happen.

20:40.385 --> 20:41.825
Let's toast Mr. Luan together.

20:42.465 --> 20:43.785
Cheers, Mr. Luan.

20:44.985 --> 20:46.225
Sorry.

20:46.305 --> 20:47.585
I'm driving, so I can't drink.

20:51.425 --> 20:52.865
You're driving? No problem.

20:52.945 --> 20:54.385
Come on, Tao. Let's drink.

20:55.345 --> 20:56.305
You did great.

21:00.345 --> 21:01.905
Well, I'll let you guys talk.

21:42.945 --> 21:44.065
Tao.

21:45.345 --> 21:46.265
Mr. Wan.

21:48.385 --> 21:49.665
Here's the thing.

21:49.745 --> 21:52.985
I know some excellent suppliers.

21:53.065 --> 21:55.225
They're highly capable and very reliable.

21:55.305 --> 21:56.385
So,

21:57.705 --> 21:58.785
I was hoping

21:59.985 --> 22:01.345
you could give me a hint.

22:02.065 --> 22:03.985
What will it take for Mr. Luan

22:04.865 --> 22:06.385
to make it happen?

22:09.825 --> 22:12.025
Mr. Wan, I think you've misunderstood.

22:13.065 --> 22:15.905
Mr. Luan created this supplier system

22:15.985 --> 22:19.385
so that every contract
can withstand public scrutiny.

22:20.785 --> 22:21.825
Excuse me.

22:22.425 --> 22:23.665
I need to use the restroom.

22:23.745 --> 22:24.625
Excuse me.

22:59.025 --> 23:00.145
Have you been avoiding me?

23:02.065 --> 23:03.105
No.

23:05.385 --> 23:06.625
"Tao"?

23:08.865 --> 23:11.465
Only third-rate salespeople
use alcohol to win clients.

23:13.705 --> 23:15.865
The sponsors helped us a lot this time,

23:15.945 --> 23:18.425
and my colleagues have been working
nonstop for over ten days.

23:18.505 --> 23:23.385
Having a drink together afterward
is just part of normal socializing.

23:23.465 --> 23:26.025
Is drinking part of workplace socializing?
Who taught you that?

23:26.105 --> 23:27.345
You did.

23:27.425 --> 23:30.705
You said if I can't handle alcohol,
I shouldn't drink at all.

23:30.785 --> 23:32.425
I wanted to try a little.

23:32.505 --> 23:34.145
Doesn't that count as progress?

23:34.745 --> 23:36.945
You also taught me
not to forget who helped me.

23:37.025 --> 23:39.945
So, of course, I'm grateful
to my clients and colleagues.

23:40.025 --> 23:41.345
I learned from the best.

23:44.025 --> 23:45.425
I supported your work too.

23:47.225 --> 23:49.345
How come you've never
shown me any gratitude?

24:01.345 --> 24:02.385
I have.

24:04.985 --> 24:07.745
Here. A medal. I got it today.

24:18.865 --> 24:19.745
I don't want it.

24:32.785 --> 24:33.825
Keep it.

24:35.025 --> 24:36.625
Let it remind you
not to keep running away.

24:59.985 --> 25:01.705
Running away keeps me safe.

25:02.425 --> 25:03.825
I'm not like you.

25:04.705 --> 25:05.785
I have to think ahead.

25:08.585 --> 25:11.025
Do accidents fit into your plans too?

25:12.385 --> 25:14.465
Was what happened on the mountain
planned too?

25:18.225 --> 25:19.065
No.

25:23.305 --> 25:25.025
Shang Zhitao, you're pretty heartless.

25:26.185 --> 25:27.545
You like me, but you keep holding back.

25:27.625 --> 25:28.665
Isn't that exhausting?

25:32.785 --> 25:34.545
Mr. Luan, I can't lose my job.

25:36.105 --> 25:38.105
The company doesn't allow office romances.

25:52.225 --> 25:53.225
If that bothers you,

25:54.825 --> 25:56.585
we can keep our relationship private.

26:06.105 --> 26:07.105
-Come on.
-Cheers.

26:07.185 --> 26:08.025
-Let's drink.
-Cheers.

26:08.105 --> 26:09.185
Cheers.

26:09.265 --> 26:10.265
Cheers!

26:12.345 --> 26:14.945
Boss, we're celebrating tonight.

26:15.025 --> 26:18.065
On behalf of Lime's female colleagues,

26:18.585 --> 26:20.025
I have a dangerous question for you.

26:21.025 --> 26:24.065
For an eligible bachelor like you,

26:24.145 --> 26:27.265
are you permanently off the market

26:27.345 --> 26:30.545
or just not taking reservations right now?

26:31.625 --> 26:32.465
Answer me!

26:33.585 --> 26:35.425
Is this what you all spend your time on?

26:35.505 --> 26:36.825
We're celebrating tonight.

26:36.905 --> 26:38.705
You can't talk shop at the dinner table.

26:38.785 --> 26:40.305
-Right?
-Exactly.

26:40.385 --> 26:41.345
-Right?
-Yes.

26:41.425 --> 26:42.425
Exactly.

26:43.465 --> 26:46.585
I think we should discuss
next week's proposal

26:46.665 --> 26:48.345
and whether you can submit it early.

26:49.025 --> 26:50.705
Please, don't. We're celebrating tonight.

26:50.785 --> 26:52.705
No KPI talk.

26:52.785 --> 26:53.785
Right, Tao?

26:59.065 --> 26:59.945
Yes.

27:01.385 --> 27:05.025
Luke, they want to ask you…

27:09.865 --> 27:11.465
Go on.

27:13.145 --> 27:14.625
They want

27:15.705 --> 27:19.105
to know whether you have a girlfriend.

27:22.185 --> 27:23.025
Good job.

27:23.545 --> 27:24.385
Answer.

27:25.785 --> 27:28.065
The only things I want to discuss
with you are work and plans.

27:28.665 --> 27:31.745
Whether I have a girlfriend
is none of your business.

27:32.865 --> 27:34.225
We don't accept that answer.

27:34.305 --> 27:36.425
-Just tell us.
-Tell us.

27:36.505 --> 27:38.425
-Tell us.
-Come on.

27:38.505 --> 27:44.145
Tell us.

27:45.145 --> 27:46.265
You really want to know?

27:46.345 --> 27:48.785
-Of course. Tell us.
-Of course.

27:48.865 --> 27:50.105
-Who is she?
-Tell us.

28:02.345 --> 28:03.865
Actually, I've been divorced twice.

28:04.905 --> 28:06.385
I work so hard

28:07.545 --> 28:09.345
because I have two children to support.

28:13.825 --> 28:17.225
Come on. Everyone over there,
raise your glasses!

28:17.305 --> 28:18.265
Come on!

28:18.345 --> 28:20.185
We're celebrating tonight. Cheers!

28:20.265 --> 28:22.945
-That's nice.
-Cheers!

28:24.065 --> 28:25.785
-How many children do you have?
-Two.

28:25.865 --> 28:26.985
Two? You have two as well?

28:27.065 --> 28:28.025
A third one's on the way.

28:30.425 --> 28:33.065
-Are you getting a cab too?
-Yes.

28:33.145 --> 28:35.985
-Then let's share one.
-Sure.

28:36.065 --> 28:37.865
-Let's go together.
-OK.

28:44.745 --> 28:45.905
I'll drive you.

28:46.825 --> 28:48.425
No need. I'm going over there.

28:51.305 --> 28:52.545
You've been drinking.

28:53.305 --> 28:55.705
-I'll drive you.
-Boss.

28:58.625 --> 29:00.065
You're still here.

29:00.145 --> 29:01.545
Perfect. I need your help.

29:02.225 --> 29:03.745
I'm not your boss after work.

29:03.825 --> 29:05.465
Didn't you already leave in a cab?

29:05.545 --> 29:08.825
The driver canceled on me
and won't answer my calls.

29:08.905 --> 29:10.105
You drove here, right?

29:10.185 --> 29:11.265
Could you give me a ride?

29:11.345 --> 29:12.545
Tao's had too much to drink, too.

29:12.625 --> 29:13.985
Give us both a ride.

29:14.065 --> 29:15.705
It's on your way. Come on.

29:16.705 --> 29:18.265
You're the best.

29:32.905 --> 29:34.865
Lumi. Address.

29:34.945 --> 29:37.625
Boss, drop Flora off first
before driving me home.

29:40.865 --> 29:43.745
By order of priority,
your place comes first.

29:43.825 --> 29:45.025
No. Drive her home first.

29:45.105 --> 29:47.905
Her place is on your way. Mine isn't.

29:48.825 --> 29:50.785
Drop me off first, then. Thanks, Luke.

29:57.265 --> 29:59.745
What cologne was Wan Jun wearing?

29:59.825 --> 30:01.145
It was suffocating me.

30:01.825 --> 30:05.065
Tao, why didn't he offer you a ride?

30:05.145 --> 30:07.745
He spent the whole night
trying to impress you.

30:08.825 --> 30:11.585
I… I was just maintaining
a client relationship.

30:11.665 --> 30:13.625
We briefly discussed
some advertising ideas.

30:15.865 --> 30:16.945
Then you should've reminded him

30:17.025 --> 30:18.825
that under Clause 17 of Lime's contract,

30:18.905 --> 30:21.865
unauthorized personnel may not
discuss possible changes to a proposal,

30:22.625 --> 30:24.025
especially not after drinking.

30:24.105 --> 30:26.145
We only discussed public information.

30:30.385 --> 30:32.705
Boss, are you flying a plane?

30:32.785 --> 30:34.225
Keep this up,
and I'll throw up in your car.

30:34.305 --> 30:36.545
Then I'll pull over up ahead.
You can get a cab.

30:36.625 --> 30:38.065
No, don't.

30:39.065 --> 30:40.585
Tomorrow, forward to Legal

30:40.665 --> 30:43.585
all records of informal communication
with their company.

30:43.665 --> 30:46.545
Remember to email them a warning.

30:47.745 --> 30:48.945
Isn't that a bit much?

31:05.625 --> 31:08.585
WELCOME HOME

31:11.985 --> 31:13.745
FRIENDLY BASKETBALL GAME

31:19.585 --> 31:20.865
If that bothers you,

31:21.465 --> 31:23.145
we can keep our relationship private.

31:24.905 --> 31:26.745
What do you mean
by a private relationship?

31:30.025 --> 31:31.705
Dating is too much trouble.

31:31.785 --> 31:34.425
And I can't be bothered
to maintain a romantic relationship.

31:35.185 --> 31:38.665
If you're willing,
we can keep this between us.

31:39.225 --> 31:40.985
If it works, we continue.

31:41.065 --> 31:42.305
If it doesn't, we end it.

31:45.625 --> 31:48.105
If either of us wants to date

31:48.185 --> 31:50.345
or sleep with someone else,

31:50.425 --> 31:51.985
we tell the other person honestly

31:55.465 --> 31:57.385
and end what we have.

32:04.345 --> 32:05.185
OK.

32:08.265 --> 32:10.345
But we have to be exclusive.

32:48.705 --> 32:50.705
I'm exhausted.

32:50.785 --> 32:53.385
I thought once Luke got promoted,
I'd get a break,

32:53.465 --> 32:56.665
bBut this supplier shake-up
has me making calls all day.

32:56.745 --> 32:58.465
What am I, a propeller?

32:58.545 --> 33:00.025
Is there anything I can help with?

33:00.105 --> 33:01.425
Not really.

33:01.505 --> 33:04.185
It's because these old suppliers
keep making snide remarks,

33:04.265 --> 33:05.305
and it's getting on my nerves.

33:05.385 --> 33:06.865
Don't let it get to you.

33:06.945 --> 33:08.465
I'm having a little get-together tonight.

33:08.545 --> 33:09.825
A girls' night.

33:09.905 --> 33:10.985
Want to come?

33:11.065 --> 33:12.585
We'll have a few drinks and have some fun.

33:13.425 --> 33:14.585
Oh, right.

33:15.545 --> 33:18.425
The system says today's your birthday.

33:18.505 --> 33:20.585
Happy birthday, Tao.

33:20.665 --> 33:21.945
What do you want for your birthday?

33:23.785 --> 33:24.625
I want…

33:24.705 --> 33:26.505
How about I set you up with someone?

33:27.105 --> 33:30.345
He's a childhood friend of mine,
three years older than you.

33:30.865 --> 33:32.985
His family owns a small restaurant,
he owns three apartments,

33:33.065 --> 33:35.025
and he's really good-looking.

33:35.105 --> 33:35.945
Think about it.

33:36.025 --> 33:38.745
If you two start dating,
you and I can hang out all the time.

33:38.825 --> 33:39.665
What do you say?

33:39.745 --> 33:41.825
I'm not looking for a boyfriend right now.

33:42.585 --> 33:45.385
Then just have dinner with him

33:45.465 --> 33:47.465
and get to know him, OK?

33:50.945 --> 33:51.865
Hello?

33:51.945 --> 33:53.505
Mr. Wan.

33:57.465 --> 33:58.545
Come in.

33:59.465 --> 34:02.585
Boss, you really saw it coming.

34:02.665 --> 34:05.385
One of Wan Jun's
recommended suppliers contacted me.

34:05.465 --> 34:08.304
A "premium supplier"
offering a 3% monthly kickback.

34:09.425 --> 34:10.985
What did you say?

34:11.065 --> 34:12.744
If they want to make money
by doing good work,

34:12.824 --> 34:14.025
they can earn it honestly,

34:14.625 --> 34:15.985
but don't try anything under the table.

34:16.065 --> 34:17.065
What a joke.

34:17.145 --> 34:17.985
Why come to me?

34:18.065 --> 34:20.385
Do I look like I need the money?

34:21.784 --> 34:23.304
How are the revisions
to the Yueteng proposal coming along?

34:24.744 --> 34:25.665
Isn't it due next week?

34:26.264 --> 34:28.465
I want it tonight.
Next week will be too late.

34:31.025 --> 34:31.865
Boss,

34:32.705 --> 34:34.105
I know a new broom sweeps clean,

34:34.185 --> 34:35.865
but could you sweep a little faster?

34:35.945 --> 34:39.304
If you ruin my habit
of never working overtime,

34:39.385 --> 34:41.025
I really can't last here.

34:41.105 --> 34:42.865
When promotion season comes,

34:42.945 --> 34:45.465
with a raise, a new car, and a new bag,

34:45.545 --> 34:46.824
you'll find a way to keep going.

34:48.545 --> 34:51.065
Fine. I'll finish it tonight.

34:52.465 --> 34:53.385
What about Flora?

34:53.465 --> 34:54.784
She can help you.

34:55.625 --> 34:58.545
You have to let Flora
leave on time tonight.

34:58.625 --> 35:00.705
-Why?
-It's her birthday.

35:01.865 --> 35:02.705
Her birthday?

35:02.785 --> 35:03.945
We're having a girls' karaoke night.

35:04.025 --> 35:05.265
We want to have a few drinks together.

35:05.945 --> 35:07.145
I'll get back to the proposal.

35:07.225 --> 35:08.945
I can still make it in time
to cut the cake with her.

35:19.505 --> 35:21.225
PURE K

35:21.305 --> 35:23.505
I'm here, girls!

35:25.185 --> 35:26.865
Happy Birthday!

35:26.945 --> 35:28.105
-Come on.
-Thank you!

35:28.185 --> 35:29.385
Let's put on "Happy Birthday".

35:29.465 --> 35:30.945
-I'm on it.
-Thank you!

35:32.945 --> 35:35.145
A birthday cake!

35:35.225 --> 35:36.065
Come on.

35:37.705 --> 35:40.945
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

35:41.025 --> 35:44.465
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

35:45.705 --> 35:47.585
<i>Happy Birthday, Tao.</i>

35:47.665 --> 35:49.065
Happy Birthday!

35:49.145 --> 35:50.825
Birthday girl, say a few words.

35:52.785 --> 35:54.305
-Come on, say something.
-All right.

35:55.185 --> 35:59.105
This is my first birthday in Beijing.

35:59.185 --> 36:00.865
Thank you all for coming.

36:00.945 --> 36:03.505
I'll have many more birthdays,

36:04.025 --> 36:07.105
and I hope you'll be there for every one.

36:07.185 --> 36:08.185
-We will.
-That's all.

36:08.265 --> 36:09.305
I love you all.

36:09.385 --> 36:11.025
We love you too.

36:13.945 --> 36:15.465
-Come on.
-Cut the cake.

36:15.545 --> 36:17.025
-Hurry.
-Cut the cake.

36:17.625 --> 36:19.465
-Time for some cake!
-Come on.

36:19.985 --> 36:21.105
It's beautiful.

36:21.185 --> 36:23.105
Cheers!

36:36.385 --> 36:38.385
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SHANG ZHITAO
FOREVER EIGHTEEN AT HEART

36:47.585 --> 36:49.185
Here comes the good stuff.

36:49.745 --> 36:50.705
Try it.

36:52.585 --> 36:55.825
I've seen people polish walnuts,
but never a phone.

36:56.585 --> 36:58.025
Keep that up, and it'll develop a patina.

36:59.305 --> 37:00.465
Is it really that hard to call?

37:02.265 --> 37:04.865
Is Ms. Shang's number too hot to handle?

37:05.745 --> 37:07.105
It's her birthday today.

37:09.345 --> 37:10.705
I see. She didn't invite you,

37:11.305 --> 37:12.625
so you came here to drown your sorrows.

37:16.105 --> 37:18.145
SHANG ZHITAO

37:27.425 --> 37:29.265
CAN YOU FINISH THE PROPOSAL TODAY?

37:33.105 --> 37:33.945
That's it?

37:38.665 --> 37:39.705
Luke,

37:40.665 --> 37:42.785
I really want to whack you
with a rolling pin from the kitchen.

37:43.865 --> 37:45.745
What are you thinking?

37:45.825 --> 37:47.945
Why is it so hard for you
to say something nice?

37:50.065 --> 37:52.025
Ms. Shang likes you,

37:52.105 --> 37:55.105
and I can tell you care about her, too.

37:55.185 --> 37:57.785
You two stop waiting for the other person
to make the first move.

37:57.865 --> 38:00.425
I know she didn't invite you
to her birthday party,

38:01.025 --> 38:03.545
but you still could've wished her
a happy birthday.

38:04.145 --> 38:05.225
Look at what you sent.

38:05.905 --> 38:09.865
Even a bank's birthday greeting
would sound warmer than that.

38:25.745 --> 38:26.585
Tao,

38:27.865 --> 38:30.545
-I need to leave early.
-Why?

38:31.185 --> 38:32.385
My landlord's taking back
the apartment tomorrow.

38:32.465 --> 38:34.105
I need to go back and pack.

38:34.185 --> 38:35.585
You're going to Hong Kong, China?

38:35.665 --> 38:36.825
Yes. I leave tomorrow.

38:36.905 --> 38:38.385
Tomorrow?

38:39.785 --> 38:42.825
My time in Beijing ends today.

38:46.945 --> 38:48.985
I haven't even had a proper talk
with you tonight.

38:49.665 --> 38:51.105
I'll miss you.

38:52.585 --> 38:54.305
Hey, it's okay.

38:54.905 --> 38:56.545
Friends don't have to be nearby.

38:58.385 --> 38:59.225
Tao,

38:59.865 --> 39:02.665
you'll definitely make something
of yourself in Beijing.

39:04.225 --> 39:08.545
Unlike you, I can't choose
between love and my career.

39:11.705 --> 39:14.505
Neither can I. But I understand you.

39:16.585 --> 39:20.785
Falling for someone
can make you feel so helpless and afraid.

39:22.265 --> 39:23.785
Love is an adventure.

39:24.305 --> 39:25.785
You can't weigh the gains and losses.

39:29.385 --> 39:32.065
It's fine. It'll all pass.

39:32.825 --> 39:33.825
We're all growing.

39:42.665 --> 39:43.705
Come on.

39:43.785 --> 39:45.225
Let me take a picture of you.

39:46.785 --> 39:47.665
What are you talking about?

39:47.745 --> 39:48.945
Love.

39:49.745 --> 39:52.145
We only live for around 30,000 days.

39:52.225 --> 39:53.345
If you like someone, tell them.

39:53.425 --> 39:54.665
If you miss them, go see them.

39:54.745 --> 39:56.745
As long as we're safe,
and it's what we want,

39:56.825 --> 39:57.905
we have nothing to lose.

39:57.985 --> 39:58.825
Exactly.

39:58.905 --> 40:03.505
My boss says any marriage
without dating first

40:03.585 --> 40:04.785
is downright indecent.

40:04.865 --> 40:08.025
Your boss just wants
everyone in China to sign up…

40:08.105 --> 40:09.945
-Exactly!
-And pay membership fees.

40:10.665 --> 40:14.425
-I don't get it.
-Cue up "Auld Lang Syne"!

40:14.505 --> 40:16.185
It's for your boss!

40:16.265 --> 40:17.105
OK!

40:18.825 --> 40:21.145
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SHANG ZHITAO
FOREVER EIGHTEEN AT HEART

41:00.665 --> 41:02.105
Luke, sorry.

41:02.185 --> 41:03.665
I didn't hear my phone ring.

41:04.185 --> 41:05.305
<i>Where are you?</i>

41:05.385 --> 41:07.065
I'm out with some friends.

41:07.665 --> 41:08.585
Have you been drinking?

41:14.545 --> 41:15.585
Is today your birthday?

41:23.825 --> 41:26.305
Why do you remember my birthday?

41:28.745 --> 41:31.225
I know. Because as my boss,

41:31.825 --> 41:35.745
you have to remember
every employee's birthday.

41:35.825 --> 41:38.465
It's part of Lime's corporate culture.

41:39.345 --> 41:40.705
Any birthday wishes?

41:42.065 --> 41:43.185
<i>Wishes?</i>

41:44.305 --> 41:46.625
Will they come true if I make them?

41:47.865 --> 41:48.785
Tell me.

41:51.105 --> 41:53.225
I want…

41:55.025 --> 41:57.225
I want the people I love

41:58.425 --> 42:00.665
to stay in Beijing forever.

42:02.665 --> 42:04.705
And I want…

42:09.305 --> 42:11.625
to hold on to whatever I can.

42:13.505 --> 42:14.785
<i>Like my job.</i>

42:15.985 --> 42:18.385
And…

42:20.265 --> 42:22.585
I want to become a better person.

42:26.265 --> 42:27.265
That's all?

42:38.185 --> 42:40.225
I want to hold on to you too,

42:41.985 --> 42:43.145
Luan Nian.

44:08.665 --> 44:10.185
Cheers, my friends!

44:10.785 --> 44:11.865
Cheers!

44:24.265 --> 44:25.105
<i>Hello?</i>

44:26.945 --> 44:28.065
Where are you?
